        "value": "<h2>Description</h2><p>The brown-plumed chocobo creates barriers on itself or allies. The brown chocobo is the desert chocobo and is hard to track down.</p><h2>Defense</h2><p>AC 13, touch 11; flat-footed 11 (+2 dex, +2 natural, -1 size)</p><p>hp 34 [52] (4d10+12)</p><p>Fort +7, Ref +6, Will +2</p><h2>Offense</h2><p>Speed 60 ft.</p><p>Melee Bite +7 (1d8+4), 2 Talons +7 (1d6+4)</p><p>Space 10 ft.; Reach 10 ft.</p><p>Special Attack Choco Stone</p><h2>Statistics</h2><p>Str 18, Dex 14, Con 16, Int 2, Wis 12, Cha 6</p><p>Base Atk +4; CMB +9; CMD 21</p><p>Feats Endurance, Run</p><p>Skills Acrobatics +17, Perception +8, Survival +2</p><p>SQ Choco Cure, Choco Guard, acrobatics, sandwalking, tame</p>"
